        "body": "\u2026Hub PRs\n\n<!-- greptile_comment -->\n\n<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=87584121\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/nero/github/rajnagani31/nero/-/pull/50\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 3/5</h2>\n\n<!-- greptile-risk -->\n\nFix duplicate prevention before merging so replayed or overlapping jobs cannot post repeated reviews.\n\n<h2>Findings</h2>\n\n1. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Replays erase duplicate protection** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/50#discussion_r4370092724\">\u25b6</a>\n2. <img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Overlapping jobs post duplicate reviews** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/50#discussion_r4370092729\">\u25b6</a>\n3. <img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\">&nbsp;**Skipped files get clean reviews** <a href=\"https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/pull/50#discussion_r4370092731\">\u25b6</a>\n\n<details open><summary><h3>Summary</h3></summary>\n\nAdds GitHub delivery for completed AI reviews, including inline comments, a Markdown summary, and saved delivery status.\n- Completed AI reviews now appear on GitHub pull requests.\n- Review jobs track GitHub delivery separately from AI review results.\n- The sample webhook payload now shows a requested check-suite event.\n</details>\n\n<details open><summary><h3>Diagram</h3></summary>\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Files as File review tasks\n    participant Aggregate as Aggregate task\n    participant DB as Database\n    participant GitHub\n    Files->>Aggregate: Findings and patch metadata\n    Aggregate->>DB: Save completed AI review\n    Aggregate->>DB: Look up posted review for commit\n    alt Posted review found\n        Aggregate->>DB: Mark job as skipped duplicate\n    else No posted review found\n        Aggregate->>GitHub: Submit summary and inline comments\n        alt Submission succeeds\n            Aggregate->>DB: Save GitHub review ID\n        else Submission fails\n            Aggregate->>DB: Save delivery error\n        end\n    end\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:3 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (1) \u00b7 Last reviewed commit: [\"feat(review): deliver automated AI revie...\"](https://github.com/rajnagani31/nero/commit/f15ac00265fef7b4e3692ce92152eda9dcd1ebe7) \u00b7 [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=review_public&utm_content=rajnagani31/nero)</sub>\n\n<!-- /greptile_comment -->",
